  "notes": "Jurisdictions with 7 years of primary and 5 of secondary: Chaco, Jujuy, La Rioja, Mendoza, Misiones, Neuquén, Río Negro, Salta, Santa Cruz, Santa Fe, Santiago del Estero and the Ciudad Autónoma de Buenos Aires (Mapa Educativo Nacional). The Ciclo Básico is the first 2 years of secondary (1° and 2° año). Technical secondary adds one year (6° año), not listed. The id is not ISO 3166-2: the group spans 12 jurisdictions."
